//
// And each partition on many threads, every loop that can: what threads
// of parallel loops send and connect from loops of the body and the texts
// they join are their partition's; a text field of a distributed
// archetype is given back by the row's owner alone, where the
// partitions share its rows.
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/ranks_threads.ent > %t.threads.one
